# Ending the turn exiles the triggered abilities on the stack (CR 724.1b) and skips straight to the cleanup step (CR 724.1d).
# Bot1 activates Sundial of the Infinite in its turn 3 upkeep with Dark Confidant's "at the beginning of your upkeep" ability on
# the stack (the earliest the ruling allows): nothing is revealed, Bot1 loses no life, and the draw step never comes, so Bot1's
# hand and library are as turn 1 left them. On turn 5 the Confidant's ability resolves - the positive control: it reveals the
# Shock on top (mana value 1) and Bot1 loses 1 life, then draws.

[Bot1 Deck]
